        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Celebrity Fifteen to One, Fifteen to One\n- Companies: Channel 4\n- People: Richard Whiteley, Anna Raeburn, Sally Jones, Rory McGrath, Alex Brooker, Jimmy Carr, Johnny Vegas, Rhod Gilbert, Gyles Brandreth\n- Roles: writer, broadcaster, actor, Member of Parliament\n\nFacts:\n- Celebrity Fifteen to One is a celebrity version of the Channel 4 game show Fifteen to One.\n- In the 1990s, Richard Whiteley, Anna Raeburn, Sally Jones, and Rory McGrath appeared on both episodes of Celebrity Fifteen to One.\n- Alex Brooker, Jimmy Carr, Johnny Vegas, Rhod Gilbert, and Gyles Brandreth each appeared on more than one episode of Celebrity Fifteen to One.\n- Gyles Daubeney Brandreth was born on 8 March 1948.\n- Gyles Brandreth is an English writer, broadcaster, actor, and former Conservative Member of Parliament.",
